gic adipose tissue surrounds the entire biopsy cavity  and gritty  tiny nodules  less than 0 1cm  over a 1 0cm area   Lie adjacent to the superior edge of the biopsy cavity  The remainder of the breast shows unremarkable white  fibrous breast parenchyma amidst adipose tissue  G H  Deep resection margin  I  Infero anterior resection margin  J K  Biopsy cavity  superior edge  L  Representative breast  M T  Axillary lymph nodes  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  additional left axilla contents  are two fragments of adipose tissue aggregating 1 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  submitted entirely in U  Gross Description by  GUILLERMO J TEARNEY  MD Resident  JUSTIN M  CATES  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY  INVASIVE CARCINOMA  GROSS DIAGNOSIS  BREAST  RIGHT   NO LESIONS SUSPICIOUS FOR INVASIVE CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  GUILLERMO J TEARNEY  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Andrew Eric Rosenberg  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michael Ned Margolies  M D  John Andrew Billings  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   INCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  ADDITIONAL LEFT AXILLARY CONTENTS  EXCISION PART C  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART D  BREAST  LEFT   MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Incisional biopsy.
